        "jsCode": "// v3: each request that ran out - its messages say so (Jessie — Request Messages, mode end)\nreturn $('Sweep Decide').all().map(i => i.json || {}).filter(j => j._sweepAction === 'expire' && j._row)\n  .map(j => ({ json: { row: JSON.stringify(Object.assign({}, j._row, { 'Status': 'EXPIRED', 'Resolved Via': 'sweep-expired', 'Decided At': j['Decided At'] })),\n    extra: JSON.stringify({ how: 'sweep-expired' }) } }));\n"
